# K:Soulbond (CardFactoryUtil.java:1740-1760): when Wolfir enters, the
# `DB$ Bond` trigger lets its controller pair it with an unpaired creature
# they control (BondEffect.java). The pair is read by Wolfir's static
# `Affected$ Creature.PairedWith,Creature.Self+Paired | AddPower$ 4`, so the
# Bears are 6/6 and survive a Lightning Bolt that would kill a 2/2.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue cardchoice 8
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 7 R
queue targets 8
castspell human 9
resolvestack
